--- AxHost.cs (fifth edit) ------------------------------------------------------------
# AxHost.ConnectionPointCookie delegates to a managed connection point instead of throwing.
# Hosts sink DWebBrowserEvents2 through this type to get the URL that NewWindow never carried;
# there is no ActiveX here, so WebBrowser.ActiveXInstance offers a managed connection point and
# this hands the sink to it. The finalizer no longer throws either - it did unconditionally,
# including for cookies whose constructor had already thrown, which aborts the process on GC.

